  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your elementals are paragons of necromental power.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Tomb Monolith<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat when you summon multiple elementals. If you summon only a single elemental, you add your mythic tier to your caster level to determine the effect of the death knell and death ward abilities your elemental gains, as well as the save DC of its death knell ability. When your elemental confirms a critical hit against a non-mythic creature, it gains two temporary negative levels.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
